# .assetignore — asset-pipeline exclusions for The Village
# Godot itself doesn't read this file; it documents what the art generators in tools/ and any
# future asset-processing step (optimisation, packing, scanning) must skip. See docs/DEVELOPMENT.md.

assets/reference/   # reference-only art (character design sheets, pixel-art frames) recovered from school coursework — never imported into the game, not real game assets
assets/audio/       # 2024 music/SFX recovered from the UE5 prototype; licences unverified — never bundle until cleared (see technical_memory/technical_memory.ipynb)
assets/branding/    # 2024 icon/splash source art; the shipped icon will be generated in the release phase
*.pxo               # Pixelorama working files - source art, not shipped
*.aseprite          # Aseprite working files - source art, not shipped
tmp/                # generator previews and screenshots - regenerable
